        "fun": "Abra sleeps 18 hours a day, and it doesn't even have to wake up to get away: it senses danger with a kind of telepathic radar and teleports to safety in its sleep. It can teleport into treetops to pick Berries, and the deeper it sleeps, the farther it goes. One Pokédex entry's advice for catching it: clear your mind first.",
